RD\"><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>14.769</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>23</mn><mo>…</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>14.769</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>23</mn><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.884</mn><mo>…</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>p</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.884</mn><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, rounding to the nearest integer, the estimated order of the method is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"105\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: 1px solid lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 1.3em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 1.3em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: 1px solid lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Indeed, this coincides with the definition of the order from the expression for the LTE:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"106\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 1em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c21D2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 1em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70F